// Screens
//
// Left empty on purpose: niri already picks a good resolution and scale for
// every screen you plug in.
//
// To change one, run `niri msg outputs` to get its name, then add a block.
// Example for a laptop panel (remove the // to use it):
//
// output "eDP-1" {
//     mode "1920x1080@60"   // resolution @ refresh rate
//     scale 1.0             // bigger number = bigger everything
//     position x=0 y=0      // where it sits next to other screens
// }
//
// More: https://yalter.github.io/niri/Configuration:-Outputs
